{"parse": {"title": "TzHaar-Mej", "pageid": 20101, "revid": 15358151, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs=TzHaar-Mej}}\n{{HasTask|TzHaar}}\n{{otheruses|the monster|the retired NPC for the Karamja Diary|TzHaar-Mej (Diary)}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|name = TzHaar-Mej\n|image = [[File:TzHaar-Mej.png|150px]]\n|release = [[19 September]] [[2005]]\n|update = Massive minigame - Fight Pits\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 103\n|size = 1\n|examine = Appears to be some kind of mystic.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|max hit = 13 [[Magic]], 9 [[Melee]]\n|aggressive = No\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Magic]], [[Crush]]\n|attack speed = 5\n|respawn = 50\n|slayxp = 100\n|cat = TzHaar\n|assignedby = chaeldar,nieve,duradel\n|hitpoints = 100\n|att = 80\n|str = 80\n|def = 80\n|mage = 120\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 0\n|dslash = 0\n|dcrush = 0\n|dmagic = 0\n|dlight = 0\n|dstandard = 0\n|dheavy = 0\n|elementalweaknesstype = Water\n|elementalweaknesspercent = 40\n|poisonresistance = 0\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = No\n|immunethrall = No\n|id = 2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160\n}}\n[[File:TzHaar-Mej chathead.png|left]]\nThe '''TzHaar-Mej''' are [[TzHaar]] mystics who guide their fellow TzHaar.{{CiteNPC|npc=TzHaar-Ket-Zuh|quote=There are the wise TzHaar-Mej who guide us, the swift TzHaar-Xil who hunt for our food, and the skilled TzHaar-Hur who craft our homes and tools.|loc=|notes=|name=}} They fight with both melee and magic using their [[Toktz-mej-tal|staves]]. \n\nWhen attacked within six tiles of other higher level TzHaar ([[TzHaar-Ket|Ket]] and [[TzHaar-Xil|Xil]]), the mage will cry out: {{overhead|Kot kl, zek e JalYt!}}, which roughly translates to \"Save me, attack the human!\" This will cause the nearby TzHaar to aid the TzHaar-Mej in combat. A TzHaar-Mej can become [[Aggressiveness|aggressive]] when any nearby [[TzHaar-Hur]] is attacked up to six tiles away from the TzHaar-Mej. \n\nThe drop rates for [[gems]] increase by 33% when wearing a charged [[ring of wealth]].\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = TzHaar-Mej (monster)\n|location = [[Mor Ul Rek]]\n|levels = 103\n|members = yes\n|mapID = 23\n|plane = 0\n|x:2480,y:5154|x:2491,y:5157|x:2528,y:5095|x:2529,y:5142|x:2461,y:5142|x:2482,y:5101|x:2490,y:5101|x:2492,y:5078|x:2497,y:5082|x:2497,y:5101|x:2500,y:5084|x:2502,y:5079|x:2508,y:5068|x:2508,y:5102|x:2510,y:5084|x:2511,y:5110|x:2455,y:5122|x:2473,y:5129|x:2475,y:5122|x:2486,y:5136|x:2437,y:5114|x:2443,y:5111|x:2456,y:5108|x:2498,y:5140|x:2502,y:5139|x:2504,y:5139|x:2517,y:5132|x:2520,y:5123|x:2537,y:5121|x:2472,y:5090|x:2477,y:5084\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Karamja\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=6444}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mob=TzHaar-Mej}}\n\n===Weapons and armour===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Obsidian cape|quantity=1|rarity=1/4096}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Toktz-mej-tal|quantity=1|rarity=1/4096}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=25|rarity=4/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fire rune|quantity=25|rarity=4/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Air rune|quantity=25|rarity=4/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Chaos rune|quantity=5|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nature rune|quantity=2|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Death rune|quantity=2|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Materials===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut sapphire|quantity=1|rarity=16/2048|altrarity=16/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d>The drop rate is increased while wearing a [[ring of wealth]] due to some \"nothing\" drops being removed.</ref>}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut emerald|quantity=1|rarity=8/2048|altrarity=8/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d />}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut ruby|quantity=1|rarity=4/2048|altrarity=4/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d />}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=1|rarity=1/2048|altrarity=1/1536|raritynotes=<ref name=row group=d />}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nothing|quantity=1|rarity=707/2048|altrarity=523/1536|gemw=No|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Some \"nothing\" drops are removed while wearing a [[ring of wealth]].</ref>}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Tokkul|quantity=1-21|rarity=62/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Tokkul|quantity=22|rarity=2/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Collection log==\nTzHaar-Mej have 2 [[collection log]] items.\n{{Sync}}\n{{Collection log list|cname1=Toktz-mej-tal|cname2=Obsidian cape}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{Hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 14 January 2026\n|update = New Player Improvements Round 2\n|change = Reverted an efficiency improvement from the previous week's update that caused TzHaar to behave incorrectly in certain scenarios. \n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 2 July 2025\n|update = Stackable Clues are here!\n|change = TzHaar now have a 40% weakness to [[water spells]].}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Gallery==\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"180\">\nTzHaar-Mej (1).png|A variant of TzHaar-Mej.\nTzHaar-Mej (2).png|A variant of TzHaar-Mej.\nTzHaar-Mej (3).png|A variant of TzHaar-Mej.\nTzHaar-Mej (4).png|A variant of TzHaar-Mej.\n</gallery>\n\n==Trivia==\n*Unlike other TzHaar monsters, the drop rate of TzHaar-Mej dropping obsidian equipment is significantly lower than the rate of other TzHaar dropping obsidian equipment, being 1/4,096 whilst the other TzHaar drop equipment at a rate of 1/512.\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Mor Ul Rek}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:15.748434+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>R